> Converted from personal notes. Amounts are for one serving. Directions are editorial, not verified source instructions.

== Ingredients ==

Gather the following ingredients: @extra virgin olive oil{1/30%cup}, @lemons{1/3}, @sea salt{1/3%tsp}, @quinoa{1/6%cup}, @water{1/3%cup}, @mint{1/12%cup}, @chickpeas{5/2%oz}, @cucumber{1/6%cup}, @ground pepper{1/3%tsp}, @parsley{1/30%cup}, @feta cheese{1/12%cup}, @red onion{1/20%cup}, @roasted and salted pistachios{1/12%cup}.

== Preparation ==

Prepare grains, proteins and other cooked components as required, then cool or hold warm as appropriate.

Combine measured ingredients, dress to taste and serve.
